418	     * {@code membershipLevel} through the controller ({@link #membershipLevel(Owner)}). Both the
419	     * create endpoint and the single-owner read endpoint return their owner through this method, so
420	     * an owner is decorated identically on either path and each derived field is computed in exactly
421	     * one place.
